0 // Underside stud sockets, measured from the part's geometry. The ends are a plate thick (sockets 8 LDU down);
0 // each end has a notch in the middle of its last row. The deep centre is solid except for stud-sized holes
0 // between the top studs (x = +/-10, +/-30; z = 0, +/-40), 20 LDU down.
0 !LDCAD SNAP_CYL [gender=F] [caps=one] [secs=R 6 4] [pos=-30 8 -110]
